## 发展

```bash
git clone https://github.com/altrr2/yandex-tools-mcp.git
cd yandex-tools-mcp
bun install
```

棉绒和格式：

```bash
bun run lint
bun run format
```

发布包：

```bash
cd packages/yandex-wordstat-mcp && npm publish
cd packages/yandex-search-mcp && npm publish
cd packages/yandex-webmaster-mcp && npm publish
```

